  <!-- EN: breach jump range -->
  <SCWC_BreachJumpRange.label>破壁跳躍距離</SCWC_BreachJumpRange.label>

  <!-- EN: The maximum distance of a breach jump. -->
  <SCWC_BreachJumpRange.description>最大破壁跳躍距離。</SCWC_BreachJumpRange.description>

  <!-- EN: breach power -->
  <SCWC_BreachPower.label>破壁威力</SCWC_BreachPower.label>

  <!-- EN: A multiplier on the damage a breach jump landing deals to walls and other structures. Creatures and mechanoids take no extra damage. -->
  <SCWC_BreachPower.description>破壁跳躍著陸時對牆壁和其他結構造成的傷害倍率。生物和機械族不會受到額外傷害。</SCWC_BreachPower.description>
